    "EV-ready circuit required (CA Energy Code) — 240V/40A dedicated circuit",
    "Solar PV required for new construction ADUs (Title 24 2022)",
    "ADU ≤600 sqft: 60A sub-panel from house main. ADU >600 sqft: new service drop with utility coordination",
    "Mini-split only — slab construction has no plenum space for duct trunks",
    "Outdoor mini-split unit must be 36in from property line (local zoning typical)",
    "Stair at 3.5ft wide max, 80in headroom min — fit stair before finalizing wet wall location",
    "Kitchen island (2BR plan) needs 4ft clearance on all sides — adjust footprint before generating"
  ],

